"vndb:s21120","name":"愛沢アンジ","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:166456","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"上杉 伶児","creatorId":"vndb:s21120","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21120","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21120","name":"愛沢アンジ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:166457","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"アメ イソベ","creatorId":"vndb:s21121","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21121","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21121","name":"アメ イソベ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:166459","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"鈴蘭 遊嬉","creatorId":"vndb:s25262","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25262","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25262","name":"鈴蘭 遊嬉","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:166460","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"古條凜","creatorId":"vndb:s52673","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s52673","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s52673","name":"古條凜","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:166462","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c105882","characterName":"字読 綴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c105882"},"originalCharacterName":"字読 綴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"510"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"189"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Forgotten asocial type."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reason for wanting to die: To at least make the choice by himself at the end."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lingering attachment to this world: To leave a scar."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious boy with an out-of-this-world appearance like that of an angel. His morbid slenderness, speech pattern and constantly changing facial expressions make it impossible for anyone to know who he is or where he comes from. Despite his strange appearance, he’s quite innocent and boyish. He also wishes to commit suicide as a human being, but frequently refers to himself as ‘non-human’."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He describes himself as an angel or a demon, but it is unclear whether he’s telling the truth or not. It also appears that he esteems conceptual beauty. Stubborn, never bending his sense of values, regardless of public opinion."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website and Twitter."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c105882"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d282ea84acf7baba31f745e63e8acb6d5f0369639e085a712309e968bad1f39.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1bbf100fe9be65ee2ff38cdb4f42ed97d803e0cab50c715764fde717a9afa43e.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴蘭 遊嬉","creatorId":"vndb:s25262","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25262","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25262","name":"鈴蘭 遊嬉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84590","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90411","characterName":"財膳 絵馬","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90411"},"originalCharacterName":"財膳 絵馬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"627"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Typical asocial type."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reason for wanting to die: Has no hope for the future."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lingering attachment to this world: Wants to show filial piety to his parents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An introverted, timid, and gloomy high school freshman, member of the manga club. He’s a kind person who loves his family but tends to lose sight of himself as a result of being too self-conscious. He has the bad habit of behaving according to what others say around him. He compares himself with other people who are the same age as him on social media, and puts himself down because of it. Besides this, he loves the well-known mascot Aopero-chan dearly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On social media, he seems to be particularly interested in animal pictures and information related to the arts. Not very good at participating in everyday conversations, but may take the initiative when it comes to certain topics. If it’s about his favourite things, he talks fast and his face lights up instantly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the only child in a family of three, living with his parents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from the official website and Twitter."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90411"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/00f5fafb6b65f54d4d06717b6486b2a25efdd9995b5a588382502861e44c0bbe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f27b8a1876b638550c54e5c6cff8feb6677984691ecba69c58f2ed29774e043.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"栂井 栄人","creatorId":"vndb:s1390","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1390","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1390","name":"栂井 栄人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84589","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90412","characterName":"枢姫 色","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90412"},"originalCharacterName":"枢姫 色","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1002"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"190"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Looks-like-an-extrovert asocial type."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reason for wanting to die: Got tired of living."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lingering attachment to this world: Wants to have a real girlfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high-school senior and former captain of the basketball team. A friendly, sociable, and cheerful playboy with an uninhibited personality that might seem unfit for reaching his goal of ‘getting a true girlfriend’. He lives alone with his foster father."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He tends to be goofy and amiable while joking around, but in reality he’s a very sceptical person. Incredibly sharp and observant with a deep sense of morality and human sensitivity. A man made up of contradictions as he’s also rational and cold-hearted, which makes him go from being open and considerate to ice-cold in an instant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He’s brimming with curiosity and repeatedly gets invested in a wide range of things, but loses interest in them very fast. Those around him look at him with either admiration or disgust. 70% of the time it’s the former. He often contradicts himself during conversations as his opinions change quite frequently. Girls and boys of all ages tend to ask him for advice a lot, so he probably knows a considerable amount of other people’s secrets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from the official website and Twitter."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90412"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91a6701afd217334c9f7f8142d8342b61644529219b031c1d1b486223f542b88.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a47e2dc0ed286e64ba89cf73bb42bf021d5ba75a446bfbbcbd437b61751a306.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"しぐれ なお","creatorId":"vndb:s17641","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17641","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17641","name":"しぐれなお","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84585","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90413","characterName":"舞渕 明陽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90413"},"originalCharacterName":"舞渕 明陽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1029"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"gender":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"169"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Acquainted-with-extroverts asocial type."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reason for wanting to die: To make those he holds dear happy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lingering attachment to this world: Overcoming the fear of death."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An intelligent and composed guy with glasses. The vice president of the student council, and a second-year student who overflows with knowledge and humour. He’s a quick thinker and has a way with words so it’s easy for both extroverts and introverts to rely on him. He’s rumoured to be surprisingly passionate. In fact, he’s a hardcore romantic and a diehard Yuri fanboy who considers ‘women’ to be somewhat sacred."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Considered to be a perfectionist with an objective point of view and tends to have great esteem for what is clean, beautiful, and untainted. He’s clearly critical, even in a roundabout way, of anything that doesn’t fit those adjectives. He sometimes says or does things that suggest he has low self-esteem. In spite of this, his own opinions can come off as quite bold and polemical."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the eldest son of a family of four, living with his parents and younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from the official website and Twitter."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90413"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36fea8ba233f5df92dd5b5fef0b63a4c9e2a066b15a0e9812e79fe59ce8b0f81.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba1a939c5fc682c678251a35e4770fcba6a5c140843f32dd451ffca7806ea048.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大園 由野","creatorId":"vndb:s21233","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21233","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21233","name":"大園 由野","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84586","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90414","characterName":"右睡 真咲也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90414"},"originalCharacterName":"右睡 真咲也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"210"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dreamy asocial type."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reason for wanting to die: Cannot become a hero."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lingering attachment to this world: Nothing in particular."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high-school senior with a behaviour like that of a small animal. For better or for worse he has an innocent personality uncharacteristic for his age, and a strong sense of justice. He values love and peace, and adores delicious food to the point of being considered a glutton."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has some extreme views and his outlook on life is kind of philosophical, but has a strong sense of responsibility. Most of the time he seems to be in a daze and this makes people think that his mind wanders through another dimension. Most likely an empath as the views of others can often grow on him and become his own."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lives with his single father after having separated from his mother and younger brother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from the official website and Twitter."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90414"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e620c0e24d74888fae9367a572ba4d6afff5ffabc6e52cdc01c0ea9a28fa6298.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/535e72ddeb7c87374e35e7a49f8e45fa3e39a32f91e1369c4b9f942841a0825e.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"麻生 修也","creatorId":"vndb:s21234","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21234","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21234","name":"麻生 修也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84587","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90415","characterName":"喰ヶ島 蜜木","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90415"},"originalCharacterName":"喰ヶ島 蜜木","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1126"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"186"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Individualistic asocial type."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reason for wanting to die: Abhorrence of old farts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lingering attachment to this world: Revenge."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A short-tempered and emotionally unstable second-year student who seems to be deep in subcultures and hasn’t joined any club. He tends to be very aggressive but is actually a very honest person who can’t hide anything. Has a strong ego and snaps at anyone around him if he doesn’t like them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, he deems any kind of prejudice as irrational and seems to harbour a deep hatred for it. Slightly hyperactive, gets worked up very easily and it’s hard for him to cool down. He’s aware that he can get carried away by violent emotions and is not rational sometimes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cosplayer who writes self-insert fanfics of his favourite character on top of having meltdowns over them. Being the fourth of seven siblings in a single-mother household, he lives with his mother and siblings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from the official website and Twitter."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90415"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/66d28eee943b62ed2df71022e1a6af79613f374e6e2929e84d9051c56612562d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1db6fe7f4eab1c19e0632ec7778e17ea8d92c797d6d355f36eb8512debc306eb.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木下 アルヴィン","creatorId":"vndb:s21955","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21955","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21955","name":"木下 アルヴィン","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84588","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90416","characterName":"新堂 林檎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90416"},"originalCharacterName":"新堂 林檎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"gender":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this tale: Shindou Ringo, you, or someone else entirely."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A meek, shy, and gentle girl who had become a shut-in to avoid the constant friction taking place between people irl. She seems to have a certain aversion towards what society considers ‘common sense’, and can even come across as ‘twisted’ in certain situations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she usually describes herself as ‘socially inept’, she can be quite assertive. She’s 